  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1) Receive VRC+ from Admin platform (in my case, from Spookality)\n\n2) Receive a Gifted VRC+ (in my case, from a Gift Drop)\n\n3) Gifted VRC+ starts from the day it was received despite Admin VRC+ already being active.\n\nI would expect Paid/Gifted VRC+ to begin after the active Admin VRC+ ends, so that real money isn't wasted on me if I happen to collect Gift Drops.",
